{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"典范丛"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“典范丛”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"alias":[{"Plain":"典范线丛"},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p>$n$ 维复流形 (或代数簇) 的典范丛是其"},{"Local":{"url":"余切丛","text":"切丛"}},{"Plain":"的 $n$ 次外积. 典范丛与"},{"Local":{"url":"Serre对偶","text":"Serre 对偶"}},{"Plain":"有关.</p>\n<p>典范丛的整体截面可定义射影嵌入, 称为典范映射 $\\varphi_n \\colon X\\to \\mathbb P(\\Gamma(X,\\omega_X)^\\vee)$. 当 $n$ 充分大时, 典范映射的像 $\\operatorname{im}\\varphi_n \\subset \\mathbb P(\\Gamma(X,\\omega_X^{\\otimes n})^\\vee)$ 是稳定的, 其维数称为"},{"Local":{"url":"小平维数","text":"小平维数"}},{"Plain":" (Kodaira dimension).</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>复流形</h3>\n<p>对于 $n$ 维复流形 $M$, 定义其上的<strong>典范线丛</strong> (canonical line bundle)\n$$\r\nK_M :=\\wedge^n {T^*}'M,\r\n$$\n其中 ${T^*}'M$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯余切丛","text":"全纯(余)切丛"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>伴随公式</h2>\n<h2>陈类</h2>\n<p>典范丛的第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nc_1(K_M) = - c_1(\\wedge^m T'M) = - c_1(M).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>典范丛平凡的情形</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"K3曲面","text":"K3 曲面"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}